  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPG GBFF Philippines Biodiversity Financing Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GBFF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Philippines Biodiversity Financing Program. As described in the project concept (PPG Request), this project aims to increase public and private sector biodiversity/nature-positive investments through the implementation of the National Biodiversity Finance Plan to support the accelerated achievement of the Kunming Montreal-Global Biodiversity Framework (KM-GBF) aligned Philippine Biodiversity Strategy and Action</narrative>
  </description>
